        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents A03-R6412, Victorian 4 Inch x 12 Inch Floor Air Register</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe ornate design of the Victorian 4 Inch x 12 Inch Register made by Brass Accents is enhanced by the 5 lovely finishes in which it is available. This air vent is easy to install in an existing or new 4 inch x 12 inch floor opening. The 4 Inch x 12 Inch Victorian Register with Damper allows you to adjust the air flow into a room.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Also Available Matching:</b>\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<a href=\"/products/4-inch-x-10-inch-victorian-register-with-damper-brass-accents-a03-r6410\"<b>4 Inch x 10 Inch Victorian Floor Register</b></a><br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/4-inch-x-14-inch-victorian-register-with-damper-brass-accents-a03-r6414\"<b>4 Inch x 14 Inch Victorian Floor Register</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Victorian 4 Inch x 12 Inch Brass Register:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Includes Damper Box to control the airflow.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Brass Accents Floor Air Register is designed to fit snugly into ducts. When determining the size of register you require, measure the opening in the floor and not the overall size of any existing registers.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BRA-reg-finishes.jpg?v=1704354502\" width=\"566\" height=\"139\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Brass Accents Register Finishes\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
