                "description": "The ornate design of the Victorian 4 Inch x 12 Inch Register made by Brass Accents is enhanced by the 5 lovely finishes in which it is available. This air vent is easy to install in an existing or new 4 inch x 12 inch floor opening. The 4 Inch x 12 Inch Victorian Register with Damper allows you to adjust the air flow into a room.",
